  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bánh cuốn are paper-thin "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "banh-cuon-wrapper"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "steamed rice sheets "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "rolled around a filling of pork and mushrooms. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "They are served with crispy fried shallots, bean sprouts, and a bowl of dipping sauce. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Steaming the rice sheets is the tricky part. A non-stick pan method is the most practical at home: pour a thin layer of batter into a lightly oiled, lidded pan, steam briefly, then roll the sheet onto a plate."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
